# Project-authored LAMMPS 4Jul2026 syntax fixture. It has never been executed.
units lj
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
read_data system.data
pair_style lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff * * 1.0 1.0 2.5
neighbor 0.3 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
velocity all create 1.0 20260719 mom yes rot no dist gaussian
fix integrate all nve
timestep 0.005
thermo 2
thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal press
thermo_modify lost error norm no
dump traj all custom 4 trajectory.lammpstrj id type x y z ix iy iz
restart 4 restart.*
run 12
